        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#human_reference_atlas"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that in FMA erythropoietic cells are types of nucleated erythrocytes and thus don&apos;t include erythrocytes.</rdfs:comment>
