        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:84791</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>heart cell</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>From Onard of the FMA: Cardiac muscle cell or cardiac myocyte is a striated muscle cell. Cardiocyte on the other hand is any cell in the heart which includes cells other than muscle cells (e.g. endothelial cell of endocardium). Unless there is a consensus among anatomists that cardiocytes refer only to muscle cells, we will treat them as a general class of cells in the heart.</rdfs:comment>
