        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043005"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The long process of a neuron that conducts nerve impulses, usually away from the cell body to the terminals and varicosities, which are sites of storage and release of neurotransmitter.</obo:IAO_0000115>
