            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An electrically insulating fatty layer that surrounds the axons of many neurons. It is an outgrowth of glial cells: Schwann cells supply the myelin for peripheral neurons while oligodendrocytes supply it to those of the central nervous system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:62983</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>NIF_Subcellular:sao593830697</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
