        <owl:annotatedTarget>The pituitary gland is an endocrine gland that secretes hormones that regulate many other glands [GO]. An endocrine gland located ventral to the diencephalon and derived from mixed neuroectodermal and non neuroectodermal origin [ZFIN].</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Pituitary_gland</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
