        <rdfs:comment>The visual cortex is made up of Brodmann area 17 (the primary visual cortex), and Brodmann area 18 and Brodmann area 19, the extrastriate cortical areas, in humans.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>visual cortex</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>visual cortex</skos:prefLabel>
