        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>sensory component of the VIIth (facial) nerve</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Wrisberg&apos;s nerve</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>intermediate nerve</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
