            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The subcommissural organ is a circumventricular organ consisting of ependymal and hypendymal cells which secrete SCO-spondin[WP,partially vetted].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>Hypendymal cells being part of the subcommissural organ is not axiomatized as it is rare in non-mammals. Consider using GCIs if this axiom needs to be added.</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:RO_0002175 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_7742"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BAMS:SCO</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BIRNLEX:1028</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0001820</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CALOHA:TS-0986</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
