    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002150">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007416"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A composite structure of the brain stem, which in NeuroNames is subdivided into the superior cerebellar peduncle of pons, the decussation of superior cerebellar peduncle and the superior cerebellar peduncle of midbrain (MM).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>we follow NIF in dividing this into 3 parts. This allows for consistency with ABA</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>we make the TAO class disjoint for now as it&apos;s not clear if this is the analagous structure</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
