        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Multi-tissue structure that has as its parts the medulla oblongata of the hindbrain and the tegmentum of the midbrain[ZFA,adopted][ZFA:0001707].</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>the stalk-like part of the brain that comprises the midbrain (aka mesencephalon), the pons (aka pons Varolii), and the medulla oblongata, and connects the cerebral hemispheres with the cervical spinal cord[MP]</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
