            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cytoarchitectural term denoting the layer of the hippocampus in which pyramidal cells are predominant. Its location is superficial to the Stratum oriens; it is deep to the Stratum radiatum in area CA1 and area CA2 and deep to the Stratum lucidum in area CA3 (Stephan-75) (NeuroNames).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>UBERON:0005369</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BAMS:Py</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
