        <obo:IAO_0000115>White matter that is part of a cerebral hemisphere.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>sometimes the term &apos;cerebral white matter&apos; may be used generically but here is refers specifically to the white matter in a hemisphere</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>The BTO class is inconsistent as it is part of the brain and spinal cord.</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
