        <obo:IAO_0000115>Nuclear complex containing the vestibular nuclei.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>In TA they are grouped in both the pons and medulla; DHBA has &apos;vestibular nuclei of pons&apos;, with LVN and SVN underneath; WP+MA says the SVN is in the pons, and GO includes VNC development under pons development, but this is not supported by ABA. Todo - check with NIF.</obo:IAO_0000116>
