        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An axon tract in the spinal cord and medulla which primarily transmits information from the forelimb and trunk. It is part of the dorsal column-medial lemniscus pathway.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000013>we assign the synonym &apos;Burdachs tract&apos; to the subclass. sometimes the term &apos;cuneate fasciculus&apos; refers specifically to cuneate fasiculus of spinal cord. We use the term more broadly here.</obo:UBPROP_0000013>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>UBERON:0004169</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
