            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>These structures are referred to as nuclei but have a layered cortical like structure. These areas include the anterior amygdaloid area, posterior amygdaloid area, the periamygdaloid cortex, and the bed nucleus of the accessory olfactory tract.</obo:IAO_0000115>
