        <oboInOwl:id>UBERON:0007224</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Connectivity notes: The medial entorhinal cortex preferentially connects with the postrhinal cortex, the presubiculum, visual association (occipital) and retrosplenial cortices[http://www.scholarpedia.org/article/Entorhinal_cortex]</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>medial entorhinal cortex</rdfs:label>
        <skos:prefLabel>medial entorhinal cortex</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
