        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any bodily fluid that has passed through a membrane such as the capillary wall, as a result of unbalanced hydrostatic and osmotic forces.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>transudative</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>characteristically low in protein and cellular content (unless there has been secondary concentration)</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
