            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The part of the future brain that is derived from the mantle layer of the neural tube.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>not clear if the MA/EMAPA classes refer specifically to the cortical subset. DHBA class incldues non-neocortex derivatives so it belongs here</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
