        <owl:annotatedTarget>In vertebrates, the hypothalamic-pituitary-target organ axis (H-P axis), the autonomic nervous system (ANS) and the diffuse neuroendocrine or APUD system contribute to the neuroendocrine system.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:15481802</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


